```{list-table} dcMetadata
:name: Monitoring_dcMetadata
:width: 100%
:header-rows: 1

* - Column name
  - Data type
  - Definition

* -  title                        
  -  Text(4000)          
  -  Name given to the dataset.<br />Required.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
* -  creatorOrganisationName      
  -  Text(4000)          
  -  Name of the organization doing the reporting.<br />Required.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        

* -  creatorElectronicMailAddress 
  -  Email - Text(250)   
  -  Email address of the point of contact in the organisation responsible for the dataset.<br />Required.                                                                                                                                                                                                              

* -  description                  
  -  Text(4000)          
  -  Description of the dataset.<br />Optional.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
* -  created                      
  -  WiseDate - Text(10) 
  -  Date of creation of the dataset.<br />Optional.<br />It must follow the format of  YYYY-MM-DD.                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
* -  language                     
  -  Language            
  -  Code of the dataset's language/s from the 'Language' codelist.<br />Optional.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
* -  license                      
  -  Licence             
  -  A legal document giving official permission to do something with the resource. Provide the URL to the licence text of a CC BY compatible licence. Use a persistent identifier to an English or multilingual version of the licence agreement.<br />Required.                                                        

* -  rights                       
  -  Text(4000)          
  -  Information about rights held in and over the resource. If necessary, provide the attribution text required by the licence, or other relevant information.<br />Optional.                                                                                                                                           

* -  rightsHolder                 
  -  Text(4000)          
  -  A person or organization owning or managing rights over the resource. This element can be provided if the rights holder reserved rights (e.g. should to be contacted for specific uses), or if the rights holder is not the organisation responsible for the dataset.<br />Optional.                                

* -  licenseDocument              
  -  Document            
  -  Documents about licensing information.<br />Optional. It must be reported if license is equal to 'exactMatch_CC_BY_4_0' o 'narrowMatch_CC_BY_4_0'<br />More than one option can be selected. If more than one, values need to be separated by a semicolon followed by a whitespace. e.g., "value1; value2; value3". 

* -  metadataDocument             
  -  Document            
  -  Documents about metadata information.<br />Optional.<br />More than one option can be selected. If more than one, values need to be separated by a semicolon followed by a whitespace. e.g., "value1; value2; value3".                                                                                              

